            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "Fakhry, M. and Ostrovsky, M. (2021). Building an Effective Smart Traffic Demand Management System in a Constrained Environment: A Design Thinking Approach. Stanford Digital Repository. Available at https://purl.stanford.edu/zm498fc4744",
